# What the meadow ring costs a tier at eye level, on the frames a player gets:
# standing in the coast's sward over the shoulder with a gust blowing, then
# walking through it, each window the `--stats` block, then the ring shown and
# hidden inside one run (`perf meadow`) against the floor (`perf noise`).
#   tools/tour.sh tours/foliage_meadow_cost.tour --seed=7 --stats --quality=ultra|high|medium|low
# Web proxy: godot --path . --rendering-method gl_compatibility -- --tour=tours/foliage_meadow_cost.tour --seed=7 --stats --quality=web
weather clear:0:wind=1
hour 16
coast calm
place coast
near meadow
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 10
await meadow 15
walk 0,-1 1.2
wait 2.0
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end meadow-standing
perf stats begin
walk 0,-1 4.0
perf stats end meadow-walking
perf meadow 6.0
perf noise 6.0
release shoulder_peek
weather rules
